※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 3027 LANG_ASSIGN_NOT_A_PLACE

※ What may stand on the left of `←` is a place: a name, or an entry of a
※ dictionary.  Anything else is a value the program worked out, and there is
※ nowhere for an assignment to put anything.

@[startup]
fn main() → u8:
    3u8 ← 4u8
    0u8
